{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"In Hell We Live, Lament","artist":"Mili","date":"2026-07-14","sourceId":"YzJm-mk52WM:004","sourceHash":"f262e86a4db927b7cbf290d52e1279b21d913ab561ed6825b7c4220a9fd4b919","duration":224.58,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":23.44,"end":25.05,"text":"I walked down a path","translation":"나는 길을 걸었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":25.05,"end":29.84,"text":"Leading to the past","translation":"과거로 이어지는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":31.63,"end":33.55,"text":"Stole from the tree's hands","translation":"나무의 손에서 훔쳤어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":35.93,"end":39.37,"text":"A regretter's friend; The forbidden fruit","translation":"후회하는 자의 벗 금단의 열매","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.96,"end":40.67,"text":"I bite off the skin","translation":"껍질을 물어뜯고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":40.67,"end":44.13,"text":"Chewing on its tender flesh","translation":"부드러운 살을 씹어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.13,"end":46.17,"text":"Quaff down its lukewarm puss","translation":"미지근한 고름을 들이켜","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":46.17,"end":50.49,"text":"You've became the \"me\" who you despised","translation":"넌 네가 경멸하던 내가 되어 버렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":50.53,"end":54.47,"text":"We've swallowed the time, let us rewind","translation":"우리는 시간을 삼켰어 되감자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":57.83,"end":58.06,"text":"Lament!","translation":"애가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":58.06,"end":60.03,"text":"If you wanted me to speak","translation":"내가 말하길 바랐다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":60.03,"end":61.97,"text":"If you wanted me to think","translation":"내가 생각하길 바랐다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":61.97,"end":65.82,"text":"If you wanted me to carry on our dreams","translation":"내가 우리의 꿈을 이어 가길 바랐다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":65.82,"end":67.23,"text":"Each loop we live through Each loop we live through","translation":"우리가 살아 내는 매 반복 우리가 살아 내는 매 반복","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":67.23,"end":69.76,"text":"The standards inside me","translation":"내 안의 기준은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":69.9,"end":71.56,"text":"The line I drew for me","translation":"내가 나를 위해 그은 선은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":71.56,"end":73.44,"text":"Lowers to the earth","translation":"땅바닥까지 내려가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":73.44,"end":73.99,"text":"Lament!","translation":"애가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":73.99,"end":75.23,"text":"Why'd you make my voice stutter?","translation":"왜 내 목소리를 더듬게 만들었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":75.23,"end":77.31,"text":"Why do truths never matter?","translation":"왜 진실은 언제나 중요하지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":77.31,"end":78.85,"text":"Why'd you curse me with","translation":"왜 넌","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":78.85,"end":81.04,"text":"\"You're a natural born genius\"?","translation":"타고난 천재라는 저주를 내렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":81.72,"end":83.94,"text":"Endless inferno (Inferno)","translation":"끝없는 지옥불 지옥불","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":84.06,"end":85.58,"text":"Counter-clock we rose","translation":"시계 반대 방향으로 우리는 일어나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":85.82,"end":88.38,"text":"Counter-clock we reload","translation":"시계 반대 방향으로 우리는 다시 장전해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":90.1,"end":93.97,"text":"Tick tick tock","translation":"째깍째깍","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":93.97,"end":96.14,"text":"Replayed thoughts","translation":"되풀이된 생각","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":96.14,"end":101.67,"text":"Forget me not","translation":"나를 잊지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":102.9,"end":105.54,"text":"I'm inside the empathic light","translation":"나는 공감의 빛 속에 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":105.54,"end":106.82,"text":"I bite off your skin","translation":"네 피부를 물어뜯고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":106.92,"end":110.12,"text":"Exposing the angels on your ribs","translation":"갈비뼈 위 천사들을 드러내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":110.12,"end":112.46,"text":"They stare at us","translation":"그들이 우리를 바라봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":112.6,"end":115.78,"text":"\"Hello, how may I help you today?\"","translation":"안녕하세요 오늘은 무엇을 도와드릴까요","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":115.96,"end":119.46,"text":"\"Please, a one-way ticket to heaven\"","translation":"천국행 편도표 한 장 주세요","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":119.63,"end":123.94,"text":"Buckled up on velvet seats","translation":"벨벳 좌석에 안전띠를 매고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":124.14,"end":127.22,"text":"Sceneries were passing by","translation":"풍경은 스쳐 지나갔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":127.22,"end":131.14,"text":"Not so different from our hell","translation":"우리의 지옥과 그리 다르지 않은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":131.14,"end":134.97,"text":"Not so different from our home","translation":"우리 집과 그리 다르지 않은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":134.97,"end":139.36,"text":"Then I realized someone's heaven","translation":"그때 알았어 누군가의 천국이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":139.71,"end":142.4,"text":"Could be the source of my torment","translation":"내 고통의 근원이 될 수도 있단 걸","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":142.4,"end":146.1,"text":"Life is allowing yourself","translation":"삶은 자신에게 허락하는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":147.82,"end":152.99,"text":"Allowing yourself to step on fire (Life is to consume)","translation":"불길을 밟도록 자신에게 허락하는 것 삶은 삼키는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":152.99,"end":154.8,"text":"Shed tears on bloodied routes","translation":"피 묻은 길에 눈물을 흘리는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":154.8,"end":156.73,"text":"(Life is to become food for each other)","translation":"(삶은 서로의 먹이가 되는 것)","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":156.73,"end":157.95,"text":"(No matter evil or good)","translation":"선이든 악이든 상관없이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":157.95,"end":159.8,"text":"Eternally in hell we live...","translation":"영원히 지옥에서 우리는 살아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":159.8,"end":162.14,"text":"(Life is fairness, life is inequality)","translation":"(삶은 공평함이고 삶은 불평등함)","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":162.14,"end":164.16,"text":"(Life is in the motion...)","translation":"삶은 움직임 속에 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":165.1,"end":166.34,"text":"By default","translation":"원래부터","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":167.26,"end":168.38,"text":"Lament!","translation":"애가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":168.62,"end":169.39,"text":"If you wanted me to live","translation":"내가 살길 바랐다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":169.39,"end":171.04,"text":"If you want me to forgive","translation":"내가 용서하길 바란다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":171.04,"end":175.15,"text":"If you want us to pretend like we're civilized humans","translation":"우리가 문명인인 척하길 바란다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":175.15,"end":176.25,"text":"Each loop we die through","translation":"우리가 죽어 가는 매 반복","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":176.25,"end":177.61,"text":"Each loop we die through","translation":"우리가 죽어 가는 매 반복","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":177.78,"end":180.2,"text":"The justice inside me","translation":"내 안의 정의는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":180.39,"end":181.41,"text":"The ego fending me","translation":"나를 지키는 자아는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":181.41,"end":182.37,"text":"Rationalize my sin","translation":"내 죄를 합리화해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":182.61,"end":183.29,"text":"Lament!","translation":"애가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":183.29,"end":184.27,"text":"Why do deaths end my torture?","translation":"왜 죽음은 내 고문을 끝내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":184.74,"end":187.17,"text":"Why can't anyone feel my hurt?","translation":"왜 아무도 내 아픔을 느끼지 못해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":187.34,"end":190.78,"text":"Why'd you crown the most violent to be champions?","translation":"왜 가장 폭력적인 자들에게 챔피언의 왕관을 씌웠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":190.78,"end":193.41,"text":"In this inferno (Inferno)","translation":"이 지옥불 속에서 지옥불","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":193.42,"end":194.9,"text":"We built for ourselves","translation":"우리가 스스로 지은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":194.9,"end":198.66,"text":"(Reviving) each other in this hell","translation":"이 지옥에서 서로를 되살리며","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}